    {
      "text": "No account, no ads, no analytics and no tracking. Your sites, rigs, targets, plans and results stay on this device. The app sends a position only to fetch the weather (Open-Meteo), to show map tiles (OpenStreetMap) and — if you switch it on in Settings, or when the site editor offers it — to look up a place name (Nominatim). Location permission is asked only when you tap \"Use current position\".",
